    {
      "id": "section-4",
      "kind": "section",
      "headline": "树结构进阶",
      "notes": "同学们注意，从线性结构到树结构的转变是计算思维的重要跃升。线性结构中每个元素只有一个前驱和后继，而树结构中每个节点可以有多个后继（子节点），但保持只有一个前驱（父节点）的特性。这个特性使得树成为表达层次关系的天然结构。特别提醒：很多同学会混淆树的高度和深度概念——高度是从下往上数（叶节点为0），深度是从上往下数（根节点为0）。接下来我们将看到，这种半线性结构为高效检索提供了可能，为下节课的二叉树遍历做铺垫。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "statement",
          "statement": "红黑树通过**颜色翻转**和**节点旋转**维持平衡，确保操作复杂度稳定在 $O(\text{log }n)$",
          "id": "sec4s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "binary-tree",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "半线性结构",
      "headline": "二叉树遍历",
      "lead": "通过家族树比喻理解二叉树的结构与遍历方式。",
      "notes": "在讲解二叉树遍历时，要特别强调三种遍历方式的区别：前序（根-左-右）、中序（左-根-右）和后序（左-右-根）。学生常犯的错误是混淆遍历顺序，特别是在处理递归实现时。可以通过简单的例子（如本页图示）展示不同遍历的实际输出结果。这里的数据结构过渡非常重要，因为从线性结构到树结构的遍历方式发生了根本变化。接下来我们将看到，在AVL树和红黑树中，这些遍历操作仍然是基础但关键的操作。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "diagramType": "cycle",
          "nodes": [
            {
              "title": "前序遍历",
              "sub": "根→左子树→右子树"
            },
            {
              "title": "中序遍历",
              "sub": "左子树→根→右子树"
            },
            {
              "title": "后序遍历",
              "sub": "左子树→右子树→根"
            }
          ],
          "id": "b7"
        },
        {
          "type": "sim",
          "engine": "widget",
          "html": "<style>\n  .widget {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    height: 100%;\n    gap: 16px;\n    padding: 16px;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n  }\n  .controls {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    background: var(--card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 150ms ease;\n  }\n  button:hover {\n    background: var(--bg2);\n  }\n  button:active {\n    transform: translateY(1px);\n  }\n  select {\n    padding: 6px;\n    background: var(--card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n  }\n  .status {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: var(--text2);\n  }\n  svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    flex: 1;\n    background: var(--bg2);\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n  }\n  .node {\n    fill: var(--card);\n    stroke: var(--line);\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n    transition: fill 150ms ease;\n  }\n  .visited {\n    fill: var(--text2);\n  }\n  .current {\n    stroke: var(--accent);\n    stroke-width: 2.5;\n  }\n  .edge {\n    stroke: var(--line);\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n  }\n  .stack-frame {\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: var(--accent);\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n    stroke-dasharray: 5 3;\n    opacity: 0;\n    transition: opacity 150ms ease;\n  }\n  .visible {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n  .label {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    fill: var(--ink);\n    text-anchor: middle;\n    dominant-baseline: middle;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"widget\">\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <select id=\"order\">\n      <option value=\"pre\">前序遍历</option>\n      <option value=\"in\" selected>中序遍历</option>\n      <option value=\"post\">后序遍历</option>\n    </select>\n    <button id=\"step\">下一步</button>\n    <button id=\"reset\">重置</button>\n    <div class=\"status\" id=\"status\">中序第一步: 访问左子树</div>\n  </div>\n  <svg id=\"tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\"></svg>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const treeData = [5,3,7,2,4,6,8];\n  let callStack = [];\n  let currentNode = 0;\n  let traversalType = 'in';\n  let visitedNodes = new Set();\n\n  const svg = document.getElementById('tree');\n  const orderSelect = document.getElementById('order');\n  const stepBtn = document.getElementById('step');\n  const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n  const statusEl = document.getElementById('status');\n\n  // Initialize tree structure\n  const treeNodes = [];\n  const treeEdges = [];\n  const stackFrames = [];\n\n  function buildTree() {\n    svg.innerHTML = '';\n    treeNodes.length = 0;\n    treeEdges.length = 0;\n    stackFrames.length = 0;\n\n    // Calculate positions\n    const positions = [];\n    const levelHeight = 80;\n    const nodeRadius = 20;\n    \n    // Root node\n    positions[0] = {x: 400, y: 60};\n    \n    // Level 1\n    positions[1] = {x: 300, y: positions[0].y + levelHeight};\n    positions[2] = {x: 500, y: positions[0].y + levelHeight};\n    \n    // Level 2\n    positions[3] = {x: 250, y: positions[1].y + levelHeight};\n    positions[4] = {x: 350, y: positions[1].y + levelHeight};\n    positions[5] = {x: 450, y: positions[2].y + levelHeight};\n    positions[6] = {x: 550, y: positions[2].y + levelHeight};\n\n    // Create edges\n    treeEdges.push(createEdge(0, 1));\n    treeEdges.push(createEdge(0, 2));\n    treeEdges.push(createEdge(1, 3));\n    treeEdges.push(createEdge(1, 4));\n    treeEdges.push(createEdge(2, 5));\n    treeEdges.push(createEdge(2, 6));\n\n    // Create nodes\n    for (let i = 0; i < treeData.length; i++) {\n      treeNodes.push(createNode(i, positions[i].x, positions[i].y, nodeRadius, treeData[i]));\n    }\n\n    // Create stack frames (initially hidden)\n    for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n      const frame = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'rect');\n      frame.classList.add('stack-frame');\n      frame.setAttribute('x', 650);\n      frame.setAttribute('y', 50 + i * 100);\n      frame.setAttribute('width', 120);\n      frame.setAttribute('height', 80);\n      svg.appendChild(frame);\n      stackFrames.push(frame);\n    }\n\n    update();\n  }\n\n  function createNode(id, x, y, r, value) {\n    const group = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'g');\n    \n    const circle = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'circle');\n    circle.classList.add('node');\n    circle.setAttribute('cx', x);\n    circle.setAttribute('cy', y);\n    circle.setAttribute('r', r);\n    circle.setAttribute('data-id', id);\n    \n    const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');\n    text.classList.add('label');\n    text.setAttribute('x', x);\n    text.setAttribute('y', y);\n    text.textContent = value;\n    \n    group.appendChild(circle);\n    group.appendChild(text);\n    svg.appendChild(group);\n    \n    return {circle, text, group};\n  }\n\n  function createEdge(from, to) {\n    const fromNode = treeNodes[from];\n    const toNode = treeNodes[to];\n    \n    const line = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');\n    line.classList.add('edge');\n    line.setAttribute('x1', fromNode.circle.getAttribute('cx'));\n    line.setAttribute('y1', fromNode.circle.getAttribute('cy'));\n    line.setAttribute('x2', toNode.circle.getAttribute('cx'));\n    line.setAttribute('y2', toNode.circle.getAttribute('cy'));\n    \n    svg.appendChild(line);\n    return line;\n  }\n\n  function update() {\n    // Update node states\n    treeNodes.forEach((node, i) => {\n      node.circle.classList.remove('visited', 'current');\n      if (visitedNodes.has(i)) {\n        node.circle.classList.add('visited');\n      }\n      if (i === currentNode) {\n        node.circle.classList.add('current');\n      }\n    });\n\n    // Update stack frames\n    stackFrames.forEach((frame, i) => {\n      frame.classList.remove('visible');\n    });\n    \n    callStack.forEach((frame, i) => {\n      if (i < stackFrames.length) {\n        stackFrames[i].classList.add('visible');\n        \n        // Add text to stack frame\n        const existingText = svg.querySelector(`.stack-text-${i}`);\n        if (existingText) existingText.remove();\n        \n        const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');\n        text.classList.add('label');\n        text.classList.add(`stack-text-${i}`);\n        text.setAttribute('x', 710);\n        text.setAttribute('y', 90 + i * 100);\n        text.textContent = `处理节点 ${treeData[frame.node]}`;\n        svg.appendChild(text);\n      }\n    });\n\n    // Update status text\n    updateStatus();\n  }\n\n  function updateStatus() {\n    let status = '';\n    if (currentNode === -1 && callStack.length === 0) {\n      status = '遍历完成';\n    } else if (callStack.length === 0) {\n      status = `${getTraversalName()}第一步: ${getFirstStepAction()}`;\n    } else {\n      const currentAction = getCurrentAction();\n      status = `${getTraversalName()}步骤: ${currentAction}`;\n    }\n    statusEl.textContent = status;\n  }\n\n  function getTraversalName() {\n    return {\n      pre: '前序',\n      in: '中序',\n      post: '后序'\n    }[traversalType];\n  }\n\n  function getFirstStepAction() {\n    return {\n      pre: '访问根节点',\n      in: '访问左子树',\n      post: '访问左子树'\n    }[traversalType];\n  }\n\n  function getCurrentAction() {\n    const frame = callStack[callStack.length - 1];\n    if (!frame) return '';\n    \n    if (frame.stage === 'before') {\n      return traversalType === 'pre' ? '访问节点' : '访问左子树';\n    } else if (frame.stage === 'middle') {\n      return traversalType === 'in' ? '访问节点' : '访问右子树';\n    } else {\n      return traversalType === 'post' ? '访问节点' : '返回';\n    }\n  }\n\n  function traverseStep() {\n    if (currentNode === -1 && callStack.length === 0) return;\n\n    if (currentNode !== -1) {\n      // Start processing a new node\n      callStack.push({node: currentNode, stage: 'before'});\n      if (traversalType === 'pre') {\n        visitedNodes.add(currentNode);\n      }\n      currentNode = getLeftChild(currentNode);\n    } else {\n      // Continue processing from stack\n      const frame = callStack[callStack.length - 1];\n      \n      if (frame.stage === 'before') {\n        frame.stage = 'middle';\n        currentNode = getRightChild(frame.node);\n        if (traversalType === 'in' && currentNode === -1) {\n          visitedNodes.add(frame.node);\n          frame.stage = 'after';\n        } else if (traversalType === 'in') {\n          callStack.push({node: currentNode, stage: 'before'});\n          currentNode = getLeftChild(currentNode);\n        }\n      } else if (frame.stage === 'middle') {\n        if (traversalType === 'in') {\n          visitedNodes.add(frame.node);\n        }\n        frame.stage = 'after';\n        currentNode = -1;\n      } else {\n        if (traversalType === 'post') {\n          visitedNodes.add(frame.node);\n        }\n        callStack.pop();\n        currentNode = -1;\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Check if traversal is complete\n    if (currentNode === -1 && callStack.length === 0) {\n      update();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    update();\n  }\n\n  function getLeftChild(index) {\n    const left = 2 * index + 1;\n    return left < treeData.length ? left : -1;\n  }\n\n  function getRightChild(index) {\n    const right = 2 * index + 2;\n    return right < treeData.length ? right : -1;\n  }\n\n  function reset() {\n    callStack = [];\n    currentNode = 0;\n    visitedNodes = new Set();\n    update();\n  }\n\n  // Event listeners\n  orderSelect.addEventListener('change', () => {\n    traversalType = orderSelect.value;\n    reset();\n  });\n\n  stepBtn.addEventListener('click', traverseStep);\n  resetBtn.addEventListener('click', reset);\n\n  // Initialize\n  buildTree();\n</script>",
